From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mio <mio@mio19.uk>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:41:42 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] overlay/asteroidos: add offline Wikipedia Kiwix reader

This patch provides an offline Wikipedia / Zim reader for AsteroidOS:

- Backed by native libzim integration for reading .zim archives.
- Custom ZimImageProvider extracting images from zim archives on demand.
- Touch-friendly library browser, search page, and article viewer.
- Full offline access to encyclopedias and travel guides on the wrist.
- Exposes kiwix in overlay/asteroidos/default.nix and apps attribute set.
